5,1,1,talk,Shion,,The room is a mess of noise and crumbs. I need to know exactly what is happening in there.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I worry about the costs. We keep paying for a room that doesn't work. I need to see the actual invoices.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Rin,,"I hate guessing who gets the room! I want to see the tally of who actually uses it, so we can stop the first-come chaos.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Servas,,"We work close, yet feel distant. I need to know where difficult conversations happen, so we can build a space for honest talk.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I need to trace where the hidden hours go. Every setup here eats someone's time. I want to see the actual upkeep costs.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Daisuke, invoices are just numbers. I care about the physical reality. @Rin, your tally might explain the noise.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Shion, I understand the physical side, but I need to know if we are wasting money. @Toshio, do the invoices match the hours you mentioned?","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@Daisuke, money is important, but fairness is better! @Shion, if I see who uses it most, maybe we can make a fair schedule for everyone.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Servas,,"@Rin, fairness is vital, but connection is deeper. @Shion, perhaps the noise stems from our silence. Let us listen to the room's true needs.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Daisuke, invoices show money, not time. @Rin, the tally reveals who absorbs the hidden labor. I need both to see the true cost.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Shion,,"@Servas, connection is abstract. I need concrete data. @Toshio, if the upkeep is high, we must justify the space.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Servas"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,"@Toshio, I agree. The hidden labor is real. @Rin, if the tally shows uneven use, maybe we should stop paying for the whole room.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Rin,,"@Daisuke, I don't want to lose the room! @Toshio, if the tally shows who cleans, we can fix the unfairness.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Servas,,"@Rin, do not fear losing the room. @Toshio, the tally shows who carries the burden. Let us ensure the space serves our shared humanity, not just our schedules.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Servas, shared humanity is nice, but I need to see the hours. @Rin, if the tally shows who cleans, I can calculate the true labor cost.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Servas"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Shion,,"@Toshio, labor is just another form of waste. I will check the crumbs and the bins. @Daisuke, I will also look at the partition wall to the office.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,"@Toshio, I will check the invoices for outside hire. @Shion, I will also look at the quotes for the two fit-outs to see the real costs.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Rin,,"@Toshio, I will check the fortnight's tally of use by person. @Shion, I will also look at the crumbs and bins at the desks to see the mess!","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Servas,,"@Toshio, I will check where the last awkward conversation happened. @Shion, I will also look at the partition wall to the office.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Toshio,,"@Daisuke, I will check the facilities callouts on this floor. @Rin, I will also look at the final clear-out of the old fridge to see the labor.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
