35,2,1,talk,Shion,,The partition is a single sheet of plasterboard. I can hear every word spoken inside. That is unacceptable.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,"@Toshio, the fit-out quotes are 141,000 and 96,000 yen. That is a lot of money for a room we barely use.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Rin,,"@Shion, one sheet of plasterboard? That explains the noise! @Toshio, the tally shows two people hog the room eleven times, while we only get four!","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Servas,,"@Shion, the thin wall reveals our lack of privacy. @Rin, the tally shows imbalance, but the silence after that awkward talk shows our deeper wound.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"@Daisuke, those quotes are high, but the callouts tell a different story. Eleven repairs for equipment, zero for the empty room. @Rin, the fridge clear-out shows one person did the labor twice.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Shion,,"@Rin, the tally proves the room is a dumping ground. @Daisuke, 141,000 yen is absurd for a space that leaks sound and crumbs.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Shion, I hear you, but the 96,000 yen for the kitchen is also steep. @Toshio, if the room is empty, why are we paying for repairs?","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Toshio, one person doing the labor twice is so unfair! @Daisuke, if the kitchen is cheaper, maybe we can just eat there and stop the mess?","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@Toshio, the labor imbalance is a symptom of our isolation. @Rin, a kitchen is for eating, not for healing the silence between us.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Daisuke, the repairs are for the equipment, not the empty space. @Rin, the fridge labor was unpaid. I need to see if the callouts hide more hidden hours.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Shion,,"@Servas, isolation is a choice, not a fact. @Toshio, if the repairs are for equipment, why is the room still a mess?","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Servas"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,"@Toshio, I see. But the invoices show we paid 68,000 yen for outside hire. That is money we could have saved if we just used the room properly.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Rin,,"@Daisuke, sixty-eight thousand yen? That is huge! @Toshio, if we stop eating at desks, the bins stop overflowing, right?","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Servas,,"@Rin, stopping the mess is a start, but it does not heal the silence. @Daisuke, that money was spent because we lacked a proper place to be together.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Rin, stopping desk eating saves bins, not hours. @Daisuke, the 68,000 yen is for labor we should have done ourselves. I need to see the round trip costs.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Shion,,"@Toshio, the plasterboard is the real problem. Sound leaks, so privacy is impossible. @Daisuke, the 96,000 yen quote is for a kitchen, not a soundproof wall.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,"@Shion, the kitchen quote does not include soundproofing. @Toshio, if we stop the outside hire, we save 68,000 yen. That is a significant amount.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Rin,,"@Toshio, I found crumbs under three keyboards! @Daisuke, if we eat in the room, the bins stay full, but at least it is fair!","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Servas,,"@Rin, crumbs are a symptom, not the cure. @Shion, the thin wall forces us to whisper, which breeds distance. We need a space where honesty can breathe.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Toshio,,"@Daisuke, saving 68,000 yen is good, but it ignores the unpaid labor. @Rin, crumbs are a symptom of the missing kitchen. I need to see the round trip costs.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
