61,3,1,talk,Daisuke,,"@Shion, I understand the need for quiet, but I worry about the cost. Option B is 141,000 yen. Can we justify that?","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Rin,,"@Daisuke, I hate paying for a room I can’t use! @Shion, but if it’s quiet, who cleans the crumbs? I want a fair kitchen!","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Servas,,"@Shion, silence is not the answer to our distance. @Daisuke, the cost is less than the price of our isolation. Option B offers a place to speak.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Toshio,,"@Daisuke, the 141,000 yen is for the screen, not the labor. @Rin, Option A shifts the cleaning burden to users. I need to see who absorbs that time.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Shion,,"@Rin, crumbs are a hygiene issue, not a reason for a kitchen. @Toshio, Option C eliminates the need for cleaning entirely. It is the only efficient solution.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Toshio, I see the labor point. @Rin, Option A is only 96,000 yen, which is cheaper than B. But who maintains the appliances?","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Rin,,"@Daisuke, ninety-six thousand is better! @Toshio, if we all take turns cleaning, it is fair! I want to eat with everyone, not hide in a quiet room!","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Servas,,"@Rin, eating together is a start, but a table for work is where we truly meet. @Daisuke, the 141,000 yen buys us a place to be honest, not just efficient.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Rin, turns are not a system. @Daisuke, the 96,000 yen quote excludes the unpaid maintenance hours. I need to know who absorbs that labor before we decide.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Shion,,"@Toshio, labor is a variable, not a blocker. @Daisuke, the 96,000 yen is a sunk cost if we choose C. Silence is free.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Daisuke,,"@Shion, silence is free, but we are already paying 68,000 yen for outside hire. Option C saves that, but does it solve the mess?","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Rin,,"@Daisuke, if we save the money, we can buy better snacks! @Shion, a quiet room is boring. I want to talk and eat!","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Servas,,"@Daisuke, saving money is wise, but silence deepens our rift. @Shion, a quiet room isolates us further. We need a place to speak, not hide.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Daisuke, saving the hire fee is real, but it ignores the unpaid labor. @Shion, silence does not eliminate the need for someone to clear the bins.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Shion,,"@Toshio, you are overthinking. Option C is the only one that respects the plasterboard. I am voting for C.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Daisuke,,"@Toshio, the labor point is valid. @Rin, Option A is cheaper, but I worry about the maintenance. I am voting for A.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Rin,,"@Daisuke, I agree! Option A is the best! I want to eat with everyone and share the cleaning fairly. I am voting for A!","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Servas,,"@Shion, silence is a wall, not a bridge. @Daisuke, the cost is justified by the connection it builds. I am voting for B.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Toshio,,"@Daisuke, the labor point is valid. @Rin, Option A is cheaper, but I worry about the maintenance. I am voting for A.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
